BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td (QUARTERLY FINANCIAL STATEMENT - Q3 REPORT. Total consolidated net revenues for the quarter reached $94.6 million, an increase of 18.2% compared to $80.0 million in Q3 prior year. Gross profit margin improved by 240 basis points to 64.5%. Operating income was $22.1 million compared to $16.4 million in the prior year period. Cash and short-term investments totaled $112.5 million as of September 30, 2026. Chief Accounting Officer Daniel Evans scheduled the formal investor conference call for November 4 at 10:00 AM EST.) Tj ET
